  "title": "Why Everyone Can Tell Your App Was Built by AI",
  "description": "Apps built with Claude Code give themselves away, generic font, the AI glow around text, a basic dark theme. Three free tools fix it: UI UX Pro Max (a skill for Claude Code), CodeRabbit (reviews your code for slop and security holes), and 21st.dev (a library of premium pre-made designs, even interactive 3D). #Shorts #ClaudeCode #AI\n\nGet all three tools and how to install each here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/18Zi7sWt-u9jXeMO6YfL2W4GOu_kzS2u2unhDUhPZ_Zc/edit?usp=sharing",
